      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We study indications, advantages, disadvantages and dosage of different antalgic for pelvic pain. Peripheral antalgics are listed in 3 groups in accordance with their properties: purely antalgic, antalgic-antipyretic, antalgic-antipyretic and anti-inflammatory. -Central drugs are listed in accordance with their narcotic properties or not, and the power of their pharmacological action."},
